<title>UK: London Tea Auction price indications.</title>
<headline>London Tea Auction price indications.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>At today's London landed Tea Auction of 6,854 packages of 53.50 kgs, including 600 offshore, price indications in pence a kilo compared to the last sale and the corresponding week last year.</p>
<p>    Best available  180   (181 and 162)</p>
<p>    Good		122   (125 and 150)</p>
<p>    Good Medium     115   (118 and 125)</p>
<p>    Medium	    107   (109 and 104)</p>
<p>    Low Medium	 90nom (nq and  90)</p>
<p>The highest price paid was 180 pence for a Rwanda PF 1</p>
</text>
